     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Exponents are performed before addition.</p>\n<p>Order of Operations (PEMDAS)</p>\n<p>Parentheses</p>\n<p>Exponents</p>\n<p>Multiplication/Division</p>\n<p>Addition/Subtraction</p>\n<p>For same order operations, work left to right.</p>"
